<title>HONG KONG: IFCT sets US$200 mln Euro 144a bond.</title>
<headline>IFCT sets US$200 mln Euro 144a bond.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-01-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following issue was announced by bookrunner Merrill Lynch &amp; Co.</p>
<p> BORROWER   THE INDUSTRIAL FINANCE CORPORATION OF THAILAND</p>
<p> AMOUNT     US$200 MLN  COUPON    7.375 PCT  MATURITY  14.JAN.07</p>
<p> TYPE	 NOTES	 ISS PRICE 99.624*    RE-OFFER  99.624*</p>
<p> PUTS	 NONE	  CALLS     NONE	 LAUNCHED  09.JAN.97</p>
<p> LISTING    NONE	  PAY FREQ SEMI-ANNUAL PAY DATE  14.JAN.97</p>
<p> RATING     A2/A	  SALES LMTS EURO 144A DENOMS    US$1K</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	   CRS DEF   YES	  FORCE MAJ --</p>
<p> GOV LAW    NEW YORK    HOME CTRY THAILAND</p>
<p> NOTES	*TO YIELD 7.429 PCT OR 90 BP OVER THE 6.5 PCT</p>
<p>		 10-YEAR U.S. TREASURY NOTE DUE OCTOBER 2006</p>
<p>	     **ISSUED OFF US$1 BLN GLOBAL MEDIUM TERM NOTE</p>
<p>		 PROGRAMME</p>
<p>	    ***UNDERWRITING DISCOUNT 0.4 PCT</p>
<p> LEAD MANAGER   MERRILL LYNCH &amp; CO (BOOKS)</p>
<p> CO-MANAGERS    LEHMAN BROTHERS, JP MORGAN &amp; CO AND SALOMON</p>
<p>		    BROTHERS INC.</p>
<p>--Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6960</p>
